{
 "file": "story/spt/f07_050_163_00_t012.spt",
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 1034,
   "src": "d5ffc2c5cce7",
   "t": "{{main}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1045,
   "src": "1d46536c60b8",
   "t": "There's a strange noise."
  },
  {
   "i": 1055,
   "src": "29f1f1321a6d",
   "t": "{{flora}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1061,
   "src": "facaaa8b2528",
   "t": "You noticed."
  },
  {
   "i": 1069,
   "src": "46e6d7abbe55",
   "t": "That's right."
  },
  {
   "i": 1072,
   "src": "cb27bfbb9526",
   "t": "It's been like this for a while."
  },
  {
   "i": 1080,
   "src": "3a4bc4cfb335",
   "t": "I can't do complex movements at once."
  },
  {
   "i": 1083,
   "src": "3340b5b4d24a",
   "t": "It's fine usually, but..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1090,
   "src": "d5ffc2c5cce7",
   "t": "{{main}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1096,
   "src": "6656eda6d94b",
   "t": "This unit looks suspicious."
  },
  {
   "i": 1099,
   "src": "5b80b04c2308",
   "t": "I've never seen this shape."
  },
  {
   "i": 1107,
   "src": "79e32fa8c97f",
   "t": "What is this?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1114,
   "src": "29f1f1321a6d",
   "t": "{{flora}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1120,
   "src": "1e322ad587b1",
   "t": "Don't ask me."
  },
  {
   "i": 1130,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1139,
   "src": "1911d7fc3744",
   "t": "This is a gyroscope."
  },
  {
   "i": 1142,
   "src": "1ac67c243bbc",
   "t": "A wheel type."
  },
  {
   "i": 1150,
   "src": "fac88cfceebf",
   "t": "It's a fairly old type."
  },
  {
   "i": 1153,
   "src": "9cd8d27c29c5",
   "t": "No wonder {{main}} doesn't know it."
  },
  {
   "i": 1164,
   "src": "f2d0594252d6",
   "t": "The bearings inside are probably worn"
  },
  {
   "i": 1167,
   "src": "6929878a88f0",
   "t": "out so it no longer spins smoothly."
  },
  {
   "i": 1175,
   "src": "6056b1139c8e",
   "t": "You know a lot about this."
  },
  {
   "i": 1183,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1189,
   "src": "2ab35287effe",
   "t": "Well, I can't compete with {{main}} in"
  },
  {
   "i": 1192,
   "src": "62c9d35d5be9",
   "t": "software, but hardware, I know a little..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1203,
   "src": "b5a2cdafe446",
   "t": "But other parts are rattling all over, too."
  },
  {
   "i": 1206,
   "src": "8726f31dde59",
   "t": "It's a wonder it still moves."
  },
  {
   "i": 1216,
   "src": "305a55e7acfe",
   "t": "{{aoi}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1225,
   "src": "b751a913eaf9",
   "t": "I'm sorry, {{flora}}. I'm sorry I couldn't take"
  },
  {
   "i": 1228,
   "src": "8967dea1a3ee",
   "t": "better care of you..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1238,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1247,
   "src": "72dde3109e3b",
   "t": "It's not your fault."
  },
  {
   "i": 1250,
   "src": "1670d0d35e62",
   "t": "It's simply the end of its lifespan."
  },
  {
   "i": 1261,
   "src": "d97294fdebd5",
   "t": "Can't we use new {{part|pl}}?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1273,
   "src": "305a55e7acfe",
   "t": "{{aoi}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1282,
   "src": "cc0584a6ce59",
   "t": "..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1290,
   "src": "b17734c57f50",
   "t": "{{flora}} is a keepsake from my mother."
  },
  {
   "i": 1293,
   "src": "0ff140daf690",
   "t": "The {{part|pl}} are, too."
  },
  {
   "i": 1301,
   "src": "a0113e00e571",
   "t": "Mom was a dancer who always danced"
  },
  {
   "i": 1304,
   "src": "49eb70cca9c4",
   "t": "with Flora. Dancing was her dream, too."
  },
  {
   "i": 1329,
   "src": "537b504892de",
   "t": "I want to dance with {{flora}}!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1332,
   "src": "fa7293c03e25",
   "t": "It has to be {{flora}} as she is now!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1340,
   "src": "0612568e2fad",
   "t": "...Ah."
  },
  {
   "i": 1348,
   "src": "2f8178a599bc",
   "t": "I'm sorry."
  },
  {
   "i": 1351,
   "src": "c5d0dacb5f0d",
   "t": "Listen to me, being so selfish--"
  },
  {
   "i": 1358,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1367,
   "src": "669e8ef39214",
   "t": "No."
  }
 ]
}
